eval("__webpack_require__.r(__webpack_exports__);\n/* harmony export */ __webpack_require__.d(__webpack_exports__, {\n/* harmony export */   privacyContent: () => (/* binding */ privacyContent),\n/* harmony export */   termsContent: () => (/* binding */ termsContent)\n/* harmony export */ });\nconst termsContent = `## Terms of Service\n\n**Last updated: July 2026**\n\nWelcome to RePIXL. These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") govern your use of the RePIXL website and marketplace. By creating an account, browsing our listings, or placing an order, you agree to these Terms.\n\n### 1. About RePIXL\nRePIXL is a curated online marketplace for vintage digital cameras and accessories. All items listed on RePIXL are sourced, inspected, and sold directly by RePIXL — we are not a peer-to-peer platform, and we do not currently support third-party sellers, trade-ins, or rentals.\n\n### 2. Accounts\nYou must provide accurate information when creating an account and are responsible for keeping your login credentials secure. You must notify us promptly if you suspect unauthorized access to your account.\n\n### 3. Product Listings & Condition Grading\nEvery camera listed on RePIXL is inspected and assigned one of four condition grades — **Mint, Excellent, Good, or Fair** — based on its physical and functional condition at the time of listing. Serial numbers are verified and multi-angle photographs are provided for every listing. Because these are vintage, one-of-a-kind or limited-stock items, available quantity may be limited to a single unit per listing.\n\n### 4. Pricing & Payment\nPrices are listed in the currency shown at checkout and are subject to change without notice until an order is placed. We accept credit/debit cards and supported local digital payment methods (including GCash and PayPal). Payment is processed at the time of order placement.\n\n### 5. Shipping & Delivery\nOrders are shipped via the courier selected at checkout. Estimated delivery windows shown at checkout are provided by our courier partners and are not guaranteed. Risk of loss transfers to you upon delivery to the courier.\n\n### 6. Returns & Refunds\nItems may be returned within **7 days of delivery** if the camera does not match its listed condition grade or is not functioning as described. Returned items must be shipped back in the condition received, with all original packaging and accessories. Refunds are issued to the original payment method once the returned item is received and inspected. Buyer's remorse returns (change of mind) may be subject to a restocking fee or declined at RePIXL's discretion, as vintage inventory is limited and non-replaceable.\n\n### 7. Order Cancellations\nOrders may be cancelled free of charge before they ship. Once an order has shipped, it is treated as a return under Section 6.\n\n### 8. Prohibited Conduct\nYou agree not to misuse the platform, including attempting to circumvent security measures, submitting false information, or using the site for any unlawful purpose.\n\n### 9. Intellectual Property\nAll content on RePIXL — including product photography, branding, and site design — is the property of RePIXL and may not be reproduced without permission.\n\n### 10. Limitation of Liability\nRePIXL is not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from use of the site, to the maximum extent permitted by law.\n\n### 11. Changes to These Terms\nWe may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.\n\n### 12. Contact\nQuestions about these Terms can be directed to our support team via the contact options listed in the site footer.`;\nconst privacyContent = `## Privacy Policy\n\n**Last updated: July 2026**\n\nThis Privacy Policy explains how RePIXL collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our website.\n\n### 1. Information We Collect\n- **Account information**: name, email address, password (stored securely, never in plain text).\n- **Order information**: shipping address, phone number, order history.\n- **Payment information**: processed by our payment and digital wallet partners — RePIXL does not store full card numbers on its own servers.\n- **Usage data**: pages visited, browsing behavior, and device/browser information, used to improve the site.\n\n### 2. How We Use Your Information\nWe use your information to process orders, provide customer support, verify condition-grading disputes, prevent fraud, and improve our services. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.\n\n### 3. Sharing With Third Parties\nWe share information only as necessary to fulfill your order — with courier partners for delivery, and with payment processors (including card networks, GCash, and PayPal) to complete transactions. These partners are only given the information required to perform their service.\n\n### 4. Cookies\nWe use cookies to keep you logged in, remember your cart and wishlist, and understand site usage. You can disable cookies in your browser, though some site features may not work correctly as a result.\n\n### 5. Data Security\nWe use industry-standard measures to protect your data, including encrypted transmission of sensitive information. No system is 100% secure, and we encourage you to use a strong, unique password for your account.\n\n### 6. Your Rights\nYou may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by contacting our support team. You may also close your account at any time.\n\n### 7. Children's Privacy\nRePIXL is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.\n\n### 8. Changes to This Policy\nWe may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Material changes will be noted with an updated \"Last updated\" date at the top of this page.\n\n### 9. Contact\nQuestions about this Privacy Policy can be directed to our support team via the contact options listed in the site footer.`;\n//# sourceURL=[module]\n//# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;charset=utf-8;base64,\n//# sourceURL=webpack-internal:///(ssr)/./src/data/legal.ts\n");

